title Vinyl at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm): now playing, the volume group, the output page, the browser, the queue with "Clear the queue?" (the toolkit's dialog unrestyled: Enter, Esc and the header's Esc cancel, Y clears), the output; the size check reports the rows under 7 mm as warnings (allow-small, the owner's rule R-4)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm, the harness's default for 640x480): the approved layout's touch rows are 70 px
# there, under the 7 mm (79 px): allow-small reports them as warnings (the owner's rule R-4) instead of failing
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot 01-now
expect esc
expect text "Vinyl"
expect text "60"
expect text "Evolve 65"
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 02-now-volume-up
expect text "63"
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 400
shot 03-output
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 300
key b
wait 400
shot 04-browser
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
key q
wait 400
shot 05-queue
expect text "Move down"
tap "Clear all"
wait 300
shot 06-queue-clear-ask
expect text "Clear the queue?"
tap "Esc"
wait 300
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "Move down"
key c
wait 300
expect text "Clear the queue?"
expect text "Y = Clear, Enter or Esc = Cancel"
# Enter presses the dialog's Primary, Cancel (the owner: "yes default cancel")
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "Move down"
key c
wait 300
shot 07-queue-clear-ask-keys
key y
wait 400
shot 08-queue-cleared
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "1 OF 1, 3 MIN LEFT"
key left
wait 300
key o
wait 400
shot 09-output-page
expect text "Automatic"
expect noquit
